[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣……倒せたんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We... we defeated another Apexi..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（外海で頂獣が出ること、大きな障害となることは、\n\u3000ランツェさんからも強く聞かされてきた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Lanze had warned us how dangerous Apexi were in the open seas...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それを乗り越える力を付けるために、\n\u3000私はランターナ大陸を旅して……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's why I journeyed across Lantarna, to build up the strength we'd need...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（出航前にも、長い時間をかけて準備を重ねて、\n\u3000こうして倒すことができて……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And after all our careful preparations before setting sail, we finally managed to defeat it...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でもこの先、何が待っているかはまったくの未知数）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But we have no idea what's waiting for us ahead.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国は、どんな場所なんだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder what the sacred lands of Nova are like..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、お疲れさま。\n果ての大陸に向けて、１つ壁を越えたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nice work, Resna. We've overcome our first obstacle on the path to World's End."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。これでようやく入口に立つことができました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. We can finally take our first real step forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "相変わらず、謙虚だね。\nもう少し喜んでも罰は当たらないと思うよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still as modest as ever, I see. You know, it wouldn't hurt to celebrate a little."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……それより。見たかい？\nさっき、ノーヴァ神聖国の船が使っていた武器",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...By the way. Did you notice? The weapons the Nova ships were using?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。あれは間違いなく、\n錬金術によって作られたもの……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Those were definitely created through alchemy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国にも、\n錬金術士がいるということでしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Does that mean Nova has an alchemist too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通りよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップさん！\u3000いつの間に！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp! When did you—?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣を倒した祝いに、喜びの舞でもと思って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought we could celebrate defeating the Apexi with a victory dance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いぇー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeeeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（これも異文化交流！\u3000よーし！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is cultural exchange too! Alright!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、こうですか、ベップさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "L-like this, Bepp?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もっと、一陣の風になるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "More like you're becoming one with the wind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、風！\u3000よぉーし、風だ、私は風になるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "T-the wind! Right, I am the wind, becoming the wind!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これが、ノーヴァ神聖国の儀式なんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is a Nova ritual?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、私独自のやつ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that's just my own thing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、そ、そうだったんですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-oh, really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ところで、\nそちらの国に錬金術士がいるというのは本当かい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About what you mentioned earlier... Is it true that Nova has an alchemist?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごくり。い、いったいどんな方なんでしょう！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*gulp* W-what are they like?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聡明で、可憐で、優秀で、能弁で、快活で……\n挙げればキリが無いわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brilliant, graceful, talented, eloquent, spirited... I could go on forever."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょうど、レスナと同じくらいの年のはず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She should be about your age, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣が討伐されたと知ったら、\n姉様もきっと喜んでくれるはず。報告するのが楽しみね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My sister will be overjoyed when she hears about the Apexi's defeat. I can't wait to tell her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その方、お名前はなんと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's her name?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――アルビーナ・ジムロック",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Alvina Zimlock."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナのアトリエを構える、\n我が国の英雄よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A hero of our nation, and proprietor of Alvina's Atelier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]